    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioners addresses the attention of this Court to annexure-II page-30 of the writ petition, which is a communication dated 13.12.2022 under RTI furnished by the Sub- Divisional Magistrate, Chenani addressed to learned counsel for the petitioners thereby confirming the fact that the acquisition exercise has not culminated into passing of any final land acquisition award yet.",
